WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.880
Most AI terminal helpers lose sight of your screen…
the moment you type ssh.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.220
Blockterm keeps it watching.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.910
It runs your real shell.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:14.840
So when the server breaks,
the agent reads the remote screen,

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.900
finds the problem,
and asks before it types.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.410
One approved keystroke at a time.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.210
Every command, a block.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.310
Suggestions, in plain words.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.120
Failures, explained.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.480
Blockterm. Open source.
Your model, your key.
